Box 52110 (0 of 2 on 0128): the forced first call ran before any search,
with no identified target, so it came back found=false; the search that
then found the target was never followed by a second call. find_warm_path
needs a target phone from a search (D132), so forcing it first only spent
a turn and told the model there was no path.

The chain itself (owner → B1 → B2 → target beside a shorter sleeping
bridge) is not something find_warm_path returns: it reads shortest paths
only. That is the members-only path read of 1849 (0116), held for Misho.

The web hold of 0125 stays.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
